{"reviewId": "276023870_86fV4yEoJ", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "**推演未来3-5年（2026-2030）的黄金剧本：**\n1.  **震荡向上（主旋律）：** 没有任何理由看空黄金的长线逻辑。它是对抗混乱、对抗货币贬值的最终堡垒。\n2.  **极端波动（插曲）：** 可能会出现类似“一周跌10%，下周涨15%”的剧烈过山车。这是因为“乱世”带来的情绪过敏。\n3.  **终局：** 等到2030年左右，新的全球货币秩序建立（比如第六次康波开启，新技术带来新增长，或者新货币协议签订），黄金才会结束它的“避险使命”，回归平庸。\n只要世界还乱，黄金就倒不了。\n", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "22673-22732", "abstract": "黄金虽然不再是货币，但依然有货币属性，当货币体系发生动荡时，黄金的价格变化则表现出明显的独立走势，显示出黄金的信用特征", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "276023870_86fV4yEoJ", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768754823, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 8, "likes": [{"userVid": 376751357, "name": "诗和远方", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-DvMcs3ddrtoK08WvLUyWY10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}], "commentsCount": 3, "ho